2540000#c3375593411269789383' title=''/><author><name>1957</name><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/blank.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2007/08/briefly-considered-here-comes-wrecking.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-6653510110513342731' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/6653510110513342731' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-262634513"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="August 6, 2007 at 8:09 PM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-2343188250095484072</id><published>2007-08-06T17:02:00.000-06:00</published><updated>2007-08-06T17:02:00.000-06:00</updated><title type='text'>Will, your news about Korrin&#39;s  hopeful prognosis ...</title><content type='html'>Will, your news about Korrin&#39;s  hopeful prognosis is very encouraging.  It is an answer to the many prayers offered by those who care about you and your family.  Thanks for the update.  &lt;BR/&gt;&lt;BR/&gt;Your blogs are greatly appreciated, too, and very much needed.  Even amidst distress, you still manage to maintain your edge!</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/6653510110513342731/comments/default/2343188250095484072'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/6653510110513342731/comments/default/2343188250095484072'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2007/08/briefly-considered-here-comes-wrecking.html?showComment=1186441320000#c2343188250095484072' title=''/><author><name>Ex-JBS</name><uri>http://www.blogger.com/profile/13022405014549557830</uri><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.